1
00:00:03,528 --> 00:00:06,087
What are you talking about?
What do you mean by his cousin?

2
00:00:06,087 --> 00:00:07,227
Who is his cousin?

3
00:00:11,312 --> 00:00:12,391
I am sorry for being late...

4
00:00:12,391 --> 00:00:13,391
Jun Seo.

5
00:00:24,393 --> 00:00:27,203
(Episode 6)

6
00:00:30,465 --> 00:00:33,971
Sin Ae, you look great.

7
00:00:33,971 --> 00:00:35,008
Why are you crying?

8
00:00:40,252 --> 00:00:41,310
It must've been hard for you.

9
00:00:42,178 --> 00:00:43,620
No.

10
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:44,670
I don't believe that.

11
00:00:45,643 --> 00:00:48,746
I heard you were doing great at school.
Jun Seo was proud of you.

12
00:00:49,573 --> 00:00:51,246
There's nothing to brag about.

13
00:00:51,246 --> 00:00:53,697
You were great, too.
You were the class president.

14
00:00:57,831 --> 00:00:59,151
Didn't you go to college?

15
00:01:00,741 --> 00:01:02,011
No.

16
00:01:02,011 --> 00:01:03,276
What do you do, then?

17
00:01:04,344 --> 00:01:07,378
- I work at a hotel.
- Do you?

18
00:01:07,378 --> 00:01:09,404
Do you work at Tae Seok's hotel?

19
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:12,975
I start to work there as a manager
from next week.

20
00:01:12,975 --> 00:01:13,975
What's your position?

21
00:01:13,975 --> 00:01:15,972
I am in the Housekeeping Department.

22
00:01:15,972 --> 00:01:18,071
I see.

23
00:01:18,071 --> 00:01:19,908
Are you working full-time?

24
00:01:20,891 --> 00:01:24,592
No, I'm not.

25
00:01:27,075 --> 00:01:29,053
Did you come from the U.S. today?

26
00:01:29,053 --> 00:01:30,590
No. I arrived yesterday.

27
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:33,174
Dad and Mom will come in a few days...

28
00:01:38,685 --> 00:01:40,287
How are they?

29
00:01:46,085 --> 00:01:49,086
Do you think they remember me?

30
00:01:51,517 --> 00:01:52,623
I don't know.

31
00:02:03,511 --> 00:02:07,192
Anyway, it is good to see you.
I have thought of you a lot.

32
00:02:09,236 --> 00:02:13,557
Mom and Dad didn't want us
to talk about you.

33
00:02:16,144 --> 00:02:19,172
We left for the U.S to forget everything.

34
00:02:20,922 --> 00:02:23,403
We had tried to forget everything.

35
00:02:26,353 --> 00:02:27,851
But I think that was too much.

36
00:02:29,258 --> 00:02:32,035
How could we stop contacting
each other just like that?

37
00:02:44,526 --> 00:02:46,193
I feel so bad for Eun Seo.

38
00:02:47,583 --> 00:02:49,280
I feel terrible.

39
00:02:50,511 --> 00:02:52,032
How could she live like that?

40
00:02:54,470 --> 00:02:57,585
I can't imagine
how much she missed her parents.

41
00:02:59,598 --> 00:03:00,962
If I were her...

42
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:05,853
How could you leave her like that?

43
00:03:05,853 --> 00:03:07,341
How could you be so cruel?

44
00:03:08,132 --> 00:03:10,750
Yoon Jun Seo, what did you do?

45
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:12,362
Where have you been until now?

46
00:03:12,362 --> 00:03:13,510
Tae Seok.

47
00:03:19,418 --> 00:03:20,418
You are right.

48
00:03:24,803 --> 00:03:26,429
I didn't do anything.

49
00:03:29,683 --> 00:03:31,293
I couldn't do anything.

50
00:03:43,026 --> 00:03:45,322
Eun Seo, stay for the night.

51
00:03:46,399 --> 00:03:49,528
I am going to bed. See you all tomorrow.

52
00:03:59,948 --> 00:04:01,473
I should go now.

53
00:04:02,135 --> 00:04:04,335
How can you go now?

54
00:04:04,335 --> 00:04:07,230
I need to go to work
for something tomorrow.

55
00:04:07,230 --> 00:04:08,417
I almost forgot.

56
00:04:09,334 --> 00:04:11,439
Is that so? Then, let's go.

57
00:04:11,805 --> 00:04:13,392
Jun Seo, what about Sin Ae?

58
00:04:14,293 --> 00:04:15,466
No, Jun Seo.

59
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:20,538
Can you take me home?

60
00:04:23,798 --> 00:04:24,798
Yes.

61
00:04:25,568 --> 00:04:26,922
Can you go now?

62
00:04:27,847 --> 00:04:29,353
Let's go.

63
00:04:29,353 --> 00:04:30,597
I will take you home.

64
00:04:34,011 --> 00:04:35,263
Sin Ae...

65
00:04:37,389 --> 00:04:38,903
wants to see you.

66
00:05:02,772 --> 00:05:04,207
I don't feel bad for you.

67
00:05:07,541 --> 00:05:08,737
I don't.

68
00:05:11,878 --> 00:05:14,095
Do I look pitiful?

69
00:05:14,095 --> 00:05:15,464
No, you don't.

70
00:05:24,606 --> 00:05:25,976
You are not pitiful.

71
00:05:28,806 --> 00:05:29,829
Because...

72
00:05:31,410 --> 00:05:33,550
I have your back from now on.

73
00:05:44,756 --> 00:05:45,896
What are you going to do?

74
00:05:49,566 --> 00:05:50,566
Calm down.

75
00:05:53,013 --> 00:05:54,653
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

76
00:05:54,653 --> 00:05:57,214
Jun Seo, don't say anything to Mom.

77
00:05:58,197 --> 00:06:00,789
Don't tell her you found Eun Seo.

78
00:06:00,789 --> 00:06:02,044
Sin Ae.

79
00:06:02,044 --> 00:06:04,812
Mom is finally getting better
in the past few years.

80
00:06:04,812 --> 00:06:07,445
She got sick because of Eun Seo.

81
00:06:07,445 --> 00:06:09,134
Because she missed Eun Seo.

82
00:06:12,028 --> 00:06:13,504
Do you really have to say that?

83
00:06:16,067 --> 00:06:17,539
I'm sorry,

84
00:06:17,539 --> 00:06:22,254
but I want Eun Seo to meet her mom.

85
00:06:22,254 --> 00:06:24,662
I think that's the only thing
I can do for her.

86
00:06:26,157 --> 00:06:29,062
You still don't care about me,
not even a little.

87
00:06:30,212 --> 00:06:32,013
Now that you've found Eun Seo,

88
00:06:32,013 --> 00:06:33,762
do you have no use for me now?

89
00:06:33,762 --> 00:06:34,978
Yoon Sin Ae.

90
00:06:34,978 --> 00:06:36,555
Yes, I'm Yoon Sin Ae.

91
00:06:36,555 --> 00:06:38,405
I'm your sister, Yoon Sin Ae.

92
00:06:41,891 --> 00:06:43,486
I was lonely in the U.S.

93
00:06:45,194 --> 00:06:48,178
Mom was sick because she missed Eun Seo.

94
00:06:48,178 --> 00:06:50,219
You and Dad kept your distance from me.

95
00:06:50,219 --> 00:06:51,512
It was hard for me.

96
00:06:53,946 --> 00:06:55,714
Seeing how Eun Seo is here now,

97
00:06:57,777 --> 00:06:59,402
what will happen to me?

98
00:07:01,948 --> 00:07:04,015
I didn't want to meet Eun Seo ever again.

99
00:07:13,244 --> 00:07:14,254
All right.

100
00:07:17,459 --> 00:07:18,629
Let's think about it.

101
00:07:22,467 --> 00:07:24,296
Let's wait until Mom and Dad get here.

102
00:07:39,525 --> 00:07:40,615
Hello.

103
00:07:42,195 --> 00:07:45,054
Jun Seo? Where are you?

104
00:07:45,054 --> 00:07:46,747
I'm at school.

105
00:07:46,747 --> 00:07:49,113
I came here straight after
taking Yu Mi to the airport.

106
00:07:50,215 --> 00:07:52,272
You didn't go to work, did you?

107
00:07:53,885 --> 00:07:56,361
When do you finish work today?
Didn't you say you would leave early?

108
00:08:42,474 --> 00:08:44,132
Professor, you have a visitor.

109
00:08:58,483 --> 00:08:59,653
How can I help you?

110
00:09:01,730 --> 00:09:03,156
You were pretty strong.

111
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:07,066
- It hurt for a few days.
- What do you want?

112
00:09:07,066 --> 00:09:09,328
- Eun Seo.
- Did you meet Eun Seo?

113
00:09:09,328 --> 00:09:10,435
No.

114
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:12,434
I guess she is doing well.

115
00:09:15,249 --> 00:09:17,890
She has an amazing guardian here.

116
00:09:18,601 --> 00:09:20,723
My mom is sick, so...

117
00:09:22,576 --> 00:09:24,307
I'm not asking you a lot.

118
00:09:24,944 --> 00:09:26,754
If you came here for that, excuse me now.

119
00:09:27,583 --> 00:09:30,456
Professor.

120
00:09:30,456 --> 00:09:33,085
If people find out you live with a girl,

121
00:09:33,085 --> 00:09:34,854
what would your school do?

122
00:09:37,684 --> 00:09:41,728
Do you think Eun Seo can keep her job?

123
00:10:01,677 --> 00:10:05,524
Thanks,
I hope you can help me from time to time.

124
00:10:05,524 --> 00:10:10,142
By the way, aren't we like brothers
from the same hometown?

125
00:10:14,475 --> 00:10:16,077
You are bad.

126
00:10:16,077 --> 00:10:17,812
You are so bad.

127
00:10:17,812 --> 00:10:20,492
Why do you make me so miserable?

128
00:10:20,492 --> 00:10:23,525
Is it not enough to bother me?
Why are you bothering my brother as well?

129
00:10:23,525 --> 00:10:25,294
- I should go.
- Eun Seo.

130
00:10:25,294 --> 00:10:28,593
- I'm fine.
- Why are you doing this to me?

131
00:10:30,039 --> 00:10:31,287
I'm all right, Eun Seo.

132
00:10:34,446 --> 00:10:35,537
Tae Seok.

133
00:10:37,045 --> 00:10:38,519
Sin Ae.

134
00:10:39,470 --> 00:10:41,656
Do you still love clinging like this?

135
00:10:43,989 --> 00:10:45,407
- Have you started to work?
- No.

136
00:10:45,407 --> 00:10:48,389
I start next week.
I came to introduce myself today.

137
00:10:48,389 --> 00:10:50,448
Tae Seok, buy me lunch.

138
00:10:52,982 --> 00:10:54,228
What do you mean?

139
00:10:55,361 --> 00:10:58,030
I won't have lunch with you anymore.

140
00:10:58,955 --> 00:11:00,570
Why? Do you have a new girl?

141
00:11:00,570 --> 00:11:02,637
How did you know that?

142
00:11:04,290 --> 00:11:07,338
Who is she?
How long will you keep her this time?

143
00:11:07,338 --> 00:11:08,534
I'm not fooling around.

144
00:11:11,169 --> 00:11:12,988
I met the CEO before coming here.

145
00:11:14,136 --> 00:11:15,136
So you met my dad?

146
00:11:16,113 --> 00:11:18,106
He told me to quit my job,
and get married.

147
00:11:18,106 --> 00:11:19,106
You.

148
00:11:20,899 --> 00:11:22,467
You should give up.

149
00:11:22,467 --> 00:11:24,894
I'm not going out with girls anymore.

150
00:11:27,307 --> 00:11:28,439
It is tasty.

151
00:11:29,140 --> 00:11:30,742
Enjoy the meal,
since it's the last lunch with me.

152
00:11:35,570 --> 00:11:37,706
Why are you so late?

153
00:11:37,706 --> 00:11:39,883
It's a cleaning day.

154
00:11:39,883 --> 00:11:41,282
Was it?

155
00:11:41,282 --> 00:11:43,014
We'll do it now.

156
00:12:23,907 --> 00:12:26,089
Do you know what my students told me?

157
00:12:26,949 --> 00:12:30,052
They believed I was a student, but I lied.

158
00:12:31,065 --> 00:12:32,593
Do I look that young?

159
00:12:33,775 --> 00:12:36,851
What do you think? Do I look really young?

160
00:12:38,152 --> 00:12:40,815
No, you look old.

161
00:12:40,815 --> 00:12:42,432
You look very old.

162
00:12:42,432 --> 00:12:43,482
What?

163
00:12:47,639 --> 00:12:49,577
By the way, you looked scary earlier.

164
00:12:52,511 --> 00:12:55,506
Of course,
you have no idea how strong I am.

165
00:12:58,951 --> 00:12:59,951
I'm sorry.

166
00:13:01,928 --> 00:13:06,276
If I had known you would be like that,
I wouldn't have given it.

167
00:13:09,056 --> 00:13:11,939
It's all right.

168
00:13:17,944 --> 00:13:20,666
Are you happy to meet me, Jun Seo?

169
00:14:33,579 --> 00:14:35,291
What did you say? Who?

170
00:14:35,291 --> 00:14:39,117
Don't you remember Yoon Jun Seo?
Eun Seo's brother.

171
00:14:42,138 --> 00:14:43,846
Do you mean the family...

172
00:14:45,809 --> 00:14:50,756
came back from the U.S.?

173
00:14:53,393 --> 00:14:54,393
What's wrong?

174
00:15:00,041 --> 00:15:02,595
Sin Ae.

175
00:15:26,322 --> 00:15:29,163
This is a great workout.

176
00:15:29,163 --> 00:15:30,586
It's not that easy.

177
00:15:32,896 --> 00:15:36,658
Let's race to the main building.

178
00:15:37,382 --> 00:15:40,238
So you want to race with your skills?
Have you got a lot of money?

179
00:15:40,238 --> 00:15:41,694
Let's race.

180
00:15:41,694 --> 00:15:43,142
If you win, you buy me breakfast.

181
00:15:43,142 --> 00:15:45,666
If I win, you give me a kiss.

182
00:15:45,666 --> 00:15:47,252
- What?
- Start!

183
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:07,440
It will take time
to get familiar with everything.

184
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,690
I am looking forward to working with you.

185
00:16:15,396 --> 00:16:17,367
It went up, so...

186
00:16:19,231 --> 00:16:20,570
It lasts longer this time.

187
00:16:24,311 --> 00:16:25,999
You should give up.

188
00:16:25,999 --> 00:16:28,386
I'm not going out with girls anymore.

189
00:16:37,792 --> 00:16:42,010
I didn't have much time to know everything
since I was transferred on short notice.

190
00:16:42,010 --> 00:16:44,090
So, I will need your support.

191
00:16:44,090 --> 00:16:46,762
We will not have a lot of changes.

192
00:16:46,762 --> 00:16:49,165
Please do what you have to do
in your position.

193
00:16:49,939 --> 00:16:51,573
I am counting on all of you.

194
00:16:55,778 --> 00:16:57,187
Is she really Sin Ae?

195
00:17:03,856 --> 00:17:04,875
Sin Ae.

196
00:17:07,585 --> 00:17:09,345
Lee Kang Hee, it has been a long time.

197
00:17:09,345 --> 00:17:11,412
Yes, it has.

198
00:17:12,226 --> 00:17:15,280
Sin Ae, it is good to see you.
I knew you would be in our department.

199
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:18,096
Are you glad to see me?
I asked Tae Seok for this.

200
00:17:19,052 --> 00:17:20,052
I see.

201
00:17:20,900 --> 00:17:24,039
By the way, why do people say
Manager Kim was fired because of you?

202
00:17:25,509 --> 00:17:29,152
Did you ask Jun Seo
to make Tae Seok do something?

203
00:17:29,152 --> 00:17:30,711
What are you talking about?

204
00:17:30,711 --> 00:17:33,167
Anyway, people see things and talk.

205
00:17:33,167 --> 00:17:35,000
So it wouldn't be any good
to show you know me.

206
00:17:38,589 --> 00:17:40,868
Let's get to work now.

207
00:17:40,868 --> 00:17:42,055
See you later.

208
00:17:43,597 --> 00:17:44,607
Sin Ae.

209
00:17:52,469 --> 00:17:53,469
Mom.

210
00:17:54,078 --> 00:17:55,249
Sin Ae.

211
00:17:56,877 --> 00:17:59,671
Are you Sin Ae?

212
00:18:01,349 --> 00:18:02,687
Are you really Sin Ae?

213
00:18:03,821 --> 00:18:06,161
Sin Ae.

214
00:18:06,161 --> 00:18:08,191
Sin Ae.

215
00:18:08,191 --> 00:18:09,494
- Sin Ae.
- Mom.

216
00:18:09,494 --> 00:18:10,967
- Sin Ae...
- Mom.

217
00:18:35,955 --> 00:18:39,471
It's great.

218
00:18:41,307 --> 00:18:45,641
They, at least...

219
00:18:47,213 --> 00:18:49,664
kept their word.

220
00:18:51,693 --> 00:18:56,048
They kept their promise
to take good care of her.

221
00:18:58,902 --> 00:19:00,257
Isn't she pretty?

222
00:19:02,261 --> 00:19:03,688
Isn't she so pretty?

223
00:19:05,583 --> 00:19:06,583
Yes, she is.

224
00:19:07,333 --> 00:19:12,659
So, is she good at school?

225
00:19:13,887 --> 00:19:14,891
Yes.

226
00:19:17,979 --> 00:19:19,533
What should I do?

227
00:19:21,075 --> 00:19:22,733
What do I have to do?

228
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:28,047
I didn't keep my word.

229
00:19:28,859 --> 00:19:30,693
What am I supposed to do?

230
00:19:33,059 --> 00:19:36,446
I'm sorry I have raised you like this.
So what should I do?

231
00:19:42,451 --> 00:19:45,062
I should've never switched you.

232
00:19:47,827 --> 00:19:50,076
I should've not.

233
00:19:53,779 --> 00:19:56,912
I only made you live like this.
So, what can I do?

234
00:19:58,755 --> 00:20:01,909
I am so sorry, Eun Seo. What should I do?

235
00:20:12,132 --> 00:20:13,397
Sin Ae.

236
00:20:50,107 --> 00:20:51,228
It is Eun Seo, isn't it?

237
00:20:52,028 --> 00:20:53,202
What is it?

238
00:20:53,202 --> 00:20:56,586
I'm just drawing it.

239
00:20:56,951 --> 00:20:58,177
You're just drawing it?

240
00:21:00,495 --> 00:21:01,800
You don't see her as your sister, do you?

241
00:21:04,991 --> 00:21:06,666
You like her, but not as your sister,
do you?

242
00:21:28,975 --> 00:21:30,242
Sin Ae.

243
00:21:41,232 --> 00:21:44,035
Has she been sick?

244
00:21:47,129 --> 00:21:49,043
Has she been very sick?

245
00:21:49,552 --> 00:21:52,378
She didn't recognize Jun Seo and me
for a while.

246
00:21:53,488 --> 00:21:57,138
She acted like she lived with you
in her dreams.

247
00:21:59,761 --> 00:22:00,947
Because of me...

248
00:22:02,983 --> 00:22:04,875
I'm not saying it's because of you.

249
00:22:06,135 --> 00:22:09,567
But, if you stay with Jun Seo,

250
00:22:09,567 --> 00:22:11,691
Mom will see you again.

251
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:15,002
I'm scared that she will get sick again.

252
00:22:17,054 --> 00:22:19,914
Jun Seo probably feels sorry for Yu Mi.

253
00:22:20,696 --> 00:22:22,731
You and Jun Seo
are not biologically related.

254
00:22:23,840 --> 00:22:25,740
Yu Mi doesn't seem to know that.

255
00:22:33,016 --> 00:22:34,034
I'm sorry.

256
00:22:35,231 --> 00:22:37,522
I know I shouldn't do this to you.

257
00:22:39,912 --> 00:22:43,754
But none of us were ourselves.

258
00:22:45,199 --> 00:22:47,410
Finally, we settled down somehow.

259
00:22:48,767 --> 00:22:52,075
Eun Seo, I'm afraid.

260
00:22:53,135 --> 00:22:56,457
I'm afraid my family might become
as it was before.

261
00:22:59,008 --> 00:23:00,722
I will not let that happen.

262
00:23:02,648 --> 00:23:04,442
What do you mean?

263
00:23:06,824 --> 00:23:08,594
Will everyone be fine if I leave?

264
00:23:13,151 --> 00:23:14,595
Will everything be fine if I leave?

265
00:23:30,029 --> 00:23:31,793
This is what you like, isn't it?

266
00:23:34,174 --> 00:23:35,399
This is good, too.

267
00:23:36,597 --> 00:23:40,245
What is this all about?
When did you do it all?

268
00:23:40,245 --> 00:23:41,465
Did you finish work early today?

269
00:23:42,061 --> 00:23:44,381
I cooked everything you like.

270
00:23:44,381 --> 00:23:45,381
I'm a good girl, aren't I?

271
00:23:48,772 --> 00:23:50,215
Thanks for the meal.

272
00:24:02,904 --> 00:24:04,783
What? Haven't you seen me eating before?

273
00:24:06,223 --> 00:24:09,159
I have, but I haven't seen you that often.

274
00:24:09,159 --> 00:24:10,689
So I want to remember this.

275
00:24:10,689 --> 00:24:12,979
You will see me eating
until you get sick of it.

276
00:24:14,714 --> 00:24:15,756
All right.

277
00:24:18,753 --> 00:24:19,836
I will get you some water.

278
00:24:30,485 --> 00:24:31,680
Do you remember it?

279
00:24:39,278 --> 00:24:40,761
You can have this now.

280
00:24:41,597 --> 00:24:43,223
Okay, my treat.

281
00:24:46,950 --> 00:24:49,597
I had it for a long time.

282
00:24:49,597 --> 00:24:51,895
From now on, you can take care of this.

283
00:24:51,895 --> 00:24:53,057
Do not break it.

284
00:24:55,638 --> 00:24:57,646
If you do, they can't be together.

285
00:25:03,551 --> 00:25:04,858
Do you want more soup?

286
00:25:51,350 --> 00:25:52,458
Eun Seo.

287
00:26:00,582 --> 00:26:01,857
Where are you going?

288
00:26:02,931 --> 00:26:04,006
Jun Seo.

289
00:26:15,299 --> 00:26:16,422
Let's go in.

290
00:26:17,300 --> 00:26:18,691
Yoon Eun Seo.

291
00:26:18,691 --> 00:26:20,308
I'm not Yoon Eun Seo.

292
00:26:20,308 --> 00:26:22,938
Jun Seo, I'm Choi Eun Seo now.

293
00:26:22,938 --> 00:26:24,733
I'm not that Eun Seo anymore, Jun Seo.

294
00:26:27,060 --> 00:26:30,848
I thought I'd be happy if I met you again.

295
00:26:32,406 --> 00:26:35,647
So, I worked hard until I met you.

296
00:26:35,647 --> 00:26:39,071
I did my best not to disappoint you
when I met you.

297
00:26:39,958 --> 00:26:42,976
That made me happy.

298
00:26:43,583 --> 00:26:44,928
I was proud of myself.

299
00:26:46,063 --> 00:26:51,247
Now I met you, but I'm not happy at all.

300
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:55,148
What is wrong with me?

301
00:26:55,148 --> 00:26:57,087
Why am I getting miserable?

302
00:26:58,901 --> 00:27:02,175
It would have been better
if we had never met.

303
00:27:03,564 --> 00:27:06,549
Eun Seo, no.

304
00:27:06,549 --> 00:27:08,524
No, Eun Seo. Stop it.

305
00:27:08,524 --> 00:27:09,613
Let's go in.

306
00:27:09,613 --> 00:27:13,454
I'll go. Let me go.

307
00:27:14,125 --> 00:27:16,501
Let's forget that we have met.

308
00:27:16,501 --> 00:27:18,661
Then I suppose we can all be happy.

309
00:27:18,661 --> 00:27:20,639
Please forget we ever met.

310
00:27:24,660 --> 00:27:25,824
No, Eun Seo.

311
00:27:27,863 --> 00:27:28,863
No, I can't.

312
00:27:31,676 --> 00:27:32,688
Don't leave.

313
00:27:34,909 --> 00:27:36,224
Don't leave, Eun Seo.

314
00:27:40,708 --> 00:27:42,311
I won't let you leave.

315
00:27:49,021 --> 00:27:50,534
I don't care if you're not my sister.

316
00:27:51,693 --> 00:27:52,864
Please stay with me.

317
00:27:54,733 --> 00:27:56,159
Stay with me, Eun Seo.

318
00:28:00,517 --> 00:28:01,832
Don't leave me, Eun Seo.

319
00:28:05,782 --> 00:28:07,105
I won't let you leave.

320
00:28:09,413 --> 00:28:10,591
Do you want to go to the beach?

321
00:28:46,664 --> 00:28:49,434
You got almost everything. Thanks.

322
00:28:50,489 --> 00:28:52,730
You come here very often, don't you?

323
00:28:52,730 --> 00:28:56,219
If you come this often,
you should get married already.

324
00:28:56,784 --> 00:28:59,408
Jun Seo wanted to talk with me.

325
00:28:59,408 --> 00:29:01,453
About the wedding?

326
00:29:02,217 --> 00:29:06,488
I don't think he wants to marry me.

327
00:29:06,488 --> 00:29:08,339
He doesn't really talk about our wedding.

328
00:29:08,339 --> 00:29:10,032
Doesn't he?

329
00:29:10,032 --> 00:29:11,910
Then marry me.

330
00:29:11,910 --> 00:29:14,199
Can I tell Eun Seo what you just said?

331
00:29:14,199 --> 00:29:16,474
No way.

332
00:29:18,511 --> 00:29:20,175
I don't understand.

333
00:29:20,175 --> 00:29:22,886
Why are all the girls falling for you,
Tae Seok?

334
00:29:22,886 --> 00:29:25,062
I think...

335
00:29:25,062 --> 00:29:26,918
I treat them very well.

336
00:29:26,918 --> 00:29:30,527
I fired the manager
who bullied Eun Seo the other day.

337
00:29:30,527 --> 00:29:31,741
What did you do?

338
00:29:33,155 --> 00:29:35,188
What is wrong with you?

339
00:29:35,188 --> 00:29:37,595
Eun Seo would be very embarrassed.

340
00:29:37,595 --> 00:29:39,250
Why would she be?

341
00:29:40,191 --> 00:29:44,256
Her colleagues would bully
Eun Seo for that.

342
00:29:46,215 --> 00:29:47,257
Would they?

343
00:29:50,206 --> 00:29:51,861
Look around later
and come to have a coffee.

344
00:29:52,953 --> 00:29:53,987
Okay.

345
00:29:56,169 --> 00:29:58,884
Will you paint again?

346
00:29:59,881 --> 00:30:02,380
Didn't you stop drawing
after you graduated?

347
00:30:03,298 --> 00:30:04,299
It's a secret.

348
00:30:04,938 --> 00:30:08,979
I see. You are going to draw someone.

349
00:30:09,976 --> 00:30:10,976
Is it Eun Seo?

350
00:30:13,809 --> 00:30:17,567
Yes. How do you know?

351
00:30:17,567 --> 00:30:18,913
It's interesting.

352
00:30:19,735 --> 00:30:21,687
Men who paint...

353
00:30:21,687 --> 00:30:24,831
want to draw the girl
they fall in love with.

354
00:30:24,831 --> 00:30:26,206
Is that so?

355
00:30:26,206 --> 00:30:28,302
I've never painted a girl.

356
00:30:30,005 --> 00:30:31,774
They probably meant nothing to you.

357
00:30:33,109 --> 00:30:37,335
I think you really like Eun Seo.

358
00:30:39,519 --> 00:30:42,236
Why is this clanking so much?

359
00:30:42,236 --> 00:30:43,454
Is there something wrong with it?

360
00:30:46,517 --> 00:30:47,872
Do you see that in me?

361
00:30:49,414 --> 00:30:50,600
I see that.

362
00:30:52,534 --> 00:30:55,299
Has Jun Seo painted you a lot?

363
00:30:58,498 --> 00:30:59,612
Hasn't he painted you?

364
00:31:02,521 --> 00:31:05,411
He has never painted me.

365
00:31:06,848 --> 00:31:09,457
He said I was too beautiful to draw.

366
00:31:09,457 --> 00:31:12,653
That's nonsense.

367
00:31:14,729 --> 00:31:17,849
Jun Seo...

368
00:31:19,513 --> 00:31:22,186
It's all right. I am okay with that.

369
00:31:22,186 --> 00:31:23,901
I knew that.

370
00:31:24,865 --> 00:31:27,889
I think it would be a meaningful life
if we...

371
00:31:27,889 --> 00:31:29,765
respect and stay considerate
of each other.

372
00:31:30,195 --> 00:31:33,445
You are so generous.

373
00:31:34,451 --> 00:31:38,907
I actually live reminding myself that...

374
00:31:38,907 --> 00:31:40,861
it is a meaningful way to live.

375
00:31:41,938 --> 00:31:46,311
But, when I forget that sometimes,

376
00:31:46,311 --> 00:31:47,595
it hurts a great deal.

377
00:31:54,932 --> 00:31:56,101
Jun Seo.

378
00:32:00,171 --> 00:32:01,357
Where is he?

379
00:32:43,570 --> 00:32:45,570
I need to talk to you.

380
00:32:45,570 --> 00:32:47,429
Can I come during the weekend?

381
00:32:47,429 --> 00:32:51,880
No, I'll come.
I also have things to bring to Tae Seok.

382
00:33:48,452 --> 00:33:50,097
Did you meet Tae Seok?

383
00:33:55,580 --> 00:33:57,767
Were you surprised I asked you
to come here suddenly?

384
00:34:07,125 --> 00:34:08,855
I need to talk to you, Yu Mi.

385
00:34:09,677 --> 00:34:12,214
I need to talk to you, too.

386
00:34:15,020 --> 00:34:18,327
Jun Seo, let's get married.

387
00:34:21,052 --> 00:34:22,869
Marry me.

388
00:34:22,869 --> 00:34:27,693
I'm tired of coming back and forth
from Seoul to Sokcho like this.

389
00:34:27,693 --> 00:34:28,842
Let's get married.

390
00:34:30,808 --> 00:34:31,919
Yu Mi.

391
00:34:31,919 --> 00:34:34,162
I was actually upset with you.

392
00:34:34,846 --> 00:34:38,119
You haven't discussed about me
moving to Sokcho.

393
00:34:38,119 --> 00:34:40,918
You didn't consult with me
about living with Eun Seo here.

394
00:34:40,918 --> 00:34:44,722
Also, you lied to me
that Eun Seo is your cousin.

395
00:34:47,471 --> 00:34:48,600
Eun Seo...

396
00:34:48,600 --> 00:34:52,283
We were supposed
to get married, weren't we?

397
00:34:59,822 --> 00:35:01,768
Jun Seo, look at me.

398
00:35:04,286 --> 00:35:05,546
Look at me.

399
00:35:12,519 --> 00:35:14,097
Don't you love me?

400
00:35:16,831 --> 00:35:22,801
Don't you love me?

401
00:35:36,383 --> 00:35:38,129
I thought I could try.

402
00:35:41,527 --> 00:35:43,606
I thought I should tell you this.

403
00:35:43,606 --> 00:35:45,105
Because I care about you.

404
00:35:48,990 --> 00:35:51,368
I think I should be honest with you.

405
00:35:53,406 --> 00:35:54,805
No.

406
00:35:54,805 --> 00:35:56,590
I should go.

407
00:35:56,590 --> 00:36:00,066
I don't want to hear it.

408
00:36:00,066 --> 00:36:01,505
I won't hear you.

409
00:36:01,505 --> 00:36:02,852
I won't hear what you say.

410
00:36:29,736 --> 00:36:30,736
Yu Mi.

411
00:36:38,496 --> 00:36:43,506
I will not let you go, Jun Seo.

412
00:36:47,240 --> 00:36:48,627
I will call you.

413
00:37:31,758 --> 00:37:35,583
Have you seen the manager
who came with Sin Ae?

414
00:37:35,583 --> 00:37:36,827
No, I haven't.

415
00:37:36,827 --> 00:37:39,237
But I heard he was good-looking.

416
00:37:40,356 --> 00:37:41,455
What are you doing?

417
00:37:42,603 --> 00:37:44,498
I'm thinking about something now.

418
00:37:44,498 --> 00:37:46,649
I wish I could sleep forever.

419
00:37:46,649 --> 00:37:48,478
So I can see him in my dreams every day.

420
00:37:48,478 --> 00:37:50,170
Are you doing that again?

421
00:37:50,170 --> 00:37:52,797
At least I'm doing something.
What about you, then?

422
00:37:55,210 --> 00:37:56,230
What about me?

423
00:37:56,941 --> 00:38:00,375
I wish you had someone like Jun Seo.

424
00:38:02,203 --> 00:38:04,391
How come Jun Seo is your brother?

425
00:38:05,426 --> 00:38:06,452
No, he is not.

426
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:09,858
To be honest,
he and you are not related biologically.

427
00:38:10,811 --> 00:38:13,653
No, you two are still siblings.

428
00:38:30,291 --> 00:38:31,555
What can I do for you?

429
00:38:31,555 --> 00:38:33,523
What can I do for you, sir?

430
00:38:34,498 --> 00:38:35,868
Why didn't you add "sir?"

431
00:38:36,882 --> 00:38:38,649
You smiled.

432
00:38:38,649 --> 00:38:41,652
Don't you think
I'm good at making you smile?

433
00:38:42,402 --> 00:38:44,170
If you don't need anything,
will you excuse me?

434
00:38:44,170 --> 00:38:45,204
Wait.

435
00:38:48,827 --> 00:38:49,829
I'm sorry.

436
00:38:52,018 --> 00:38:54,689
I didn't know you could apologize.

437
00:38:54,689 --> 00:38:56,212
Tae Seok, you have changed a lot.

438
00:38:57,833 --> 00:38:58,833
Tae Seok?

439
00:39:01,369 --> 00:39:03,069
Tae Seok...

440
00:39:05,362 --> 00:39:06,426
Tae Seok?

441
00:39:06,426 --> 00:39:07,908
What did you page me for?

442
00:39:08,562 --> 00:39:10,309
Have a seat first.

443
00:39:14,760 --> 00:39:15,819
Sit.

444
00:39:19,417 --> 00:39:20,916
Do you know Manager Kim?

445
00:39:21,600 --> 00:39:23,175
The Manager Kim?

446
00:39:23,175 --> 00:39:25,074
She will be reinstated
in the Housekeeping Department.

447
00:39:26,431 --> 00:39:28,398
I didn't just sign it this time.

448
00:39:28,398 --> 00:39:30,624
I apologized to her appropriately.

449
00:39:33,230 --> 00:39:36,570
Isn't this the kind of man you like?

450
00:39:44,535 --> 00:39:46,273
I can't live without you now.

451
00:39:47,023 --> 00:39:49,144
Don't make me wait long, and come to me.

452
00:39:53,406 --> 00:39:54,658
Come to me.

453
00:40:19,321 --> 00:40:20,659
Am I bothering you?

454
00:40:21,984 --> 00:40:23,036
Yes, you are.

455
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:27,995
Aren't you hungry?
Should I grab something?

456
00:40:28,560 --> 00:40:29,560
Yes.

457
00:40:30,540 --> 00:40:31,540
I will be right back.

458
00:40:44,401 --> 00:40:45,825
Jun Seo?

459
00:40:45,825 --> 00:40:47,056
Excuse me.

460
00:40:49,025 --> 00:40:50,140
Who are you?

461
00:40:50,864 --> 00:40:53,804
I am Yu Mi's mother.

462
00:40:58,834 --> 00:41:04,363
Are you Jun Seo's cousin?

463
00:41:06,377 --> 00:41:07,377
Yes.

464
00:41:10,625 --> 00:41:12,955
I heard a lot about you from Yu Mi.

465
00:41:13,929 --> 00:41:16,868
Do you live here?

466
00:41:19,497 --> 00:41:20,497
Yes.

467
00:41:24,488 --> 00:41:25,523
Ms. Eun Seo.

468
00:41:27,793 --> 00:41:32,716
Do you know why Jun Seo
wants to break up with Yu Mi?

469
00:41:34,528 --> 00:41:35,996
What do you mean to break up with her?

470
00:41:37,392 --> 00:41:38,925
Do you know anything about it?

471
00:41:46,346 --> 00:41:48,939
What have you done?

472
00:41:48,939 --> 00:41:50,966
Do you know how Yu Mi is now?

473
00:41:55,275 --> 00:41:58,810
What are you going to do with Yu Mi?

474
00:41:58,810 --> 00:42:02,396
How could you do that,
when you knew she was in the hospital?

475
00:42:03,204 --> 00:42:06,493
Is Yu Mi seriously sick?

476
00:42:13,090 --> 00:42:14,526
I have nothing to say.

477
00:42:15,348 --> 00:42:18,614
Are you the Jun Seo that I know?

478
00:42:19,731 --> 00:42:20,957
How can you do this?

479
00:42:23,947 --> 00:42:27,590
Are you seeing someone else?

480
00:42:41,720 --> 00:42:43,722
- Jun Seo.
- Yes.

481
00:42:46,113 --> 00:42:49,177
Did you really break up with Yu Mi?

482
00:42:54,496 --> 00:42:56,987
Why? Why did you, Jun Seo?

483
00:42:58,262 --> 00:43:00,715
I love someone else.

484
00:43:17,647 --> 00:43:19,442
Did my mom come?

485
00:43:21,749 --> 00:43:22,749
Yes.

486
00:43:23,359 --> 00:43:25,386
What did she say?

487
00:43:28,975 --> 00:43:31,923
Were you there?

488
00:43:34,705 --> 00:43:37,289
Did you have an argument with Jun Seo?

489
00:43:40,079 --> 00:43:43,561
No, it wasn't serious.

490
00:43:45,905 --> 00:43:48,194
I didn't think my mom would come here.

491
00:43:49,102 --> 00:43:50,209
I see.

492
00:43:53,671 --> 00:43:54,938
Eun Seo.

493
00:44:04,023 --> 00:44:06,601
Eun Seo, please help me out.

494
00:44:09,230 --> 00:44:11,698
You can help me.

495
00:44:14,111 --> 00:44:18,153
You are the only one who can help me.

496
00:44:20,439 --> 00:44:25,153
Jun Seo cares about you a lot.

497
00:44:26,695 --> 00:44:28,503
You are his sister...

498
00:44:31,548 --> 00:44:32,911
he really cares about.

499
00:44:37,340 --> 00:44:41,574
You are his sister, so please help me out.

500
00:44:49,059 --> 00:44:53,493
I was a sickly child,

501
00:44:55,283 --> 00:44:57,982
so I couldn't get along with anyone.

502
00:45:01,018 --> 00:45:03,710
I was very weak, so...

503
00:45:03,710 --> 00:45:05,849
I have never been helpful to Jun Seo.

504
00:45:08,302 --> 00:45:11,656
I thought about leaving him several times.

505
00:45:15,821 --> 00:45:19,607
But I know now.

506
00:45:21,695 --> 00:45:25,452
I am nothing without Jun Seo.

507
00:45:27,972 --> 00:45:29,088
Yes.

508
00:45:29,870 --> 00:45:33,538
Because of his responsibility,

509
00:45:33,538 --> 00:45:36,980
he has been with me. I know that.

510
00:45:39,986 --> 00:45:42,606
Although I know that I...

511
00:45:44,724 --> 00:45:47,206
I want him to be with me.

512
00:45:48,652 --> 00:45:49,799
I want him.

513
00:45:55,188 --> 00:45:56,311
I am sorry.

514
00:45:57,565 --> 00:45:59,006
I am sorry, Eun Seo.

515
00:46:03,323 --> 00:46:04,614
Don't say that.

516
00:46:05,892 --> 00:46:07,213
Don't say that.

517
00:46:29,075 --> 00:46:31,130
But, if you stay with Jun Seo,

518
00:46:31,130 --> 00:46:33,285
Mom will see you again.

519
00:46:35,194 --> 00:46:36,952
I'm scared that she will get sick again.

520
00:46:37,762 --> 00:46:39,389
I can't live without you now.

521
00:46:40,298 --> 00:46:42,453
Don't make me wait long, and come to me.

522
00:46:46,476 --> 00:46:47,518
Come to me.

523
00:46:47,907 --> 00:46:51,149
I thought about leaving him several times.

524
00:46:55,378 --> 00:46:59,366
But I know now.

525
00:47:01,282 --> 00:47:05,132
I am nothing without Jun Seo.

526
00:47:14,852 --> 00:47:15,902
Choi Eun Seo.

527
00:47:20,674 --> 00:47:22,110
What are you doing?

528
00:47:40,595 --> 00:47:44,317
I have no sense of shame.

529
00:47:44,884 --> 00:47:47,629
So, I don't care about others
and get whatever I want.

530
00:47:48,330 --> 00:47:51,725
Also, I get anything I would hate
on someone else.

531
00:47:55,476 --> 00:47:56,750
Let me get you, too.

532
00:48:00,683 --> 00:48:02,111
You can trust me.
